/uploads/2023/05/6.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" class=\"wp-image-5403\" srcset=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6-200x117.png 200w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6-400x233.png 400w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6-600x350.png 600w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/6.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></span></li><li class=\"image\"><span class=\"fusion-image-hover-element hover-type-none\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/7.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" class=\"wp-image-5404\" srcset=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/7-200x117.png 200w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/7-400x233.png 400w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/7-600x350.png 600w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/7.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></span></li><li class=\"image\"><span class=\"fusion-image-hover-element hover-type-none\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/11.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" class=\"wp-image-5407\" srcset=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/11-200x117.png 200w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/11-400x233.png 400w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/11-600x350.png 600w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/11.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></span></li><li class=\"image\"><span class=\"fusion-image-hover-element hover-type-none\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/9.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" class=\"wp-image-5410\" srcset=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/9-200x117.png 200w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/9-400x233.png 400w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/9.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></span></li><li class=\"image\"><span class=\"fusion-image-hover-element hover-type-none\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" class=\"wp-image-5409\" srcset=\"https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-200x117.png 200w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-400x233.png 400w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1-600x350.png 600w, https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/1.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 1200px\" /></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-3\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Department of Trade and Industry &#8211; Fair Trade Enforcement Bureau (DTI-FTEB) seized 294 units of vaporized nicotine and non-nicotine products, and novel tobacco products worth Php 121,910.00 during its focused enforcement operation in Taguig City, on 08 May 2023.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The common violations of vape establishments are the sale of vapor products that are appealing to minors, such as those with fruit, candy brand, and dessert or cartoon characters; and the sale and promotion of the said products within one hundred (100) meters from any point of the perimeter of a school, playground, or other facility frequented by minors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">FTEB Director Atty. Fhillip D. Sawali and FTEB Enforcement and Product Standards Monitoring Division Chief Ms. Perpetua Werlina R. Lim led the inspection of vape products being sold by 14 vape stores in Taguig</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The DTI urges consumers to report violators through the Consumer Care Hotline at DTI (1-384) or consumercare@dti.gov.ph.</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"></div></div></div></div>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "", "protected": false}, "author": 11, "featured_media": 0, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "categories": [107], "tags": [], "class_list": ["post-5435", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "hentry", "category-updates"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/5435", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/posts"}], "about": [{"href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/types/post"}], "author": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/users/11"}], "replies": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/comments?post=5435"}], "version-history": [{"count": 5, "href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/5435/revisions"}], "predecessor-version": [{"id": 5452, "href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/5435/revisions/5452"}], "wp:attachment": [{"href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=5435"}], "wp:term": [{"taxonomy": "category", "embeddable": true, "href": "https://fairtrade.dti.gov.ph/wp-json/wp/v2/categories?post=5435"}, {"taxonomy": "post_tag", "embeddable": true, "href": "https://fairtrade.d